# PMOVES.AI Submodules Configuration
# =============================================================================
# Agent Coordination & Security Architecture
# =============================================================================
#
# All submodules are CORE COMPONENTS required for PMOVES.AI functionality.
# Services are organized by tier:
#   - Orchestrators: Agent Zero (primary), Archon (agent service)
#   - AI Services: PMOVES-n8n, PMOVES-Deep-Serch, PMOVES-YT, etc.
#   - Knowledge Base: PMOVES-Open-Notebook, PMOVES-HiRAG
#   - Security Hardening: Container security baseline enforcement
#
# Branch Strategy:
#   Most submodules track PMOVES.AI-Edition-Hardened branch
#   Exceptions tracking main:
#     - E2B/infra tier: E2B-Danger-Room, Danger-infra, Pipecat, MAI-UI, Headscale
#       (independent release cadence from hardened fleet)
#     - Tooling: ClawZ, skills/* (5 forks — Pmoves-skills, awesome-agent-skills,
#       fork-repository-skill, agent-sandbox-skill, claude-d3js-skill)
#   Note: Pmoves-cipher was migrated from main → PMOVES.AI-Edition-Hardened
#     on 2026-07-13 (PR #2116, A1-Shim re-fork from campfirein/byterover-cli upstream).
#   Exception tracking PMOVES.AI-Edition-Hardened-DoX:
#     - PMOVES-DoX (nested Agent Zero MCP tool for standalone mode)
#
# GitHub Actions CI/CD:
#   Push to hardened triggers automated builds via integrations-ghcr.yml
#   Path triggers on core submodules ensure image updates propagate
#
# =============================================================================

# =============================================================================
# Core Agent & Orchestration Services
# =============================================================================

[submodule "PMOVES-Agent-Zero"]
	path = PMOVES-Agent-Zero
	url = https://github.com/POWERFULMOVES/PMOVES-Agent-Zero.git
