# MIGRATION NOTES (2026-02-07):
# The e2b components were previously vendored under pmoves/vendor/e2b/*
# They have been migrated to proper forked submodules (see below).
# The vendor entries are commented out to prevent git errors while
# preserving history for reference during branch transitions.
